I am the official head of the official LogFest convention committee.

I would very, very much like help with planning events and picking
the space and such.

If you have any interest in helping out at all, please mail me, but
in particular I would very much like it if someone would survey the
cost for meeting rooms in Fairfax, VA area hotels.

If someone wants to take this on, please mail me to let me know, but
don't bother waiting for me to respond, just go for it.  You may
want to start with
http://www.visitfairfax.org/hotels_dulles.htm#fairfax

I've been looking at the Courtyard by Marriott, because I've had
good experiences at similar hotels, but you needn't feel bound by
that at all.

It would be nice to have meeting space for at least 12 people.

Thank you in advance!

-Robin

